<title>HONG KONG: China Apollo 1996 net loss HK$10.94 mln.</title>
<headline>China Apollo 1996 net loss HK$10.94 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.3 loss   vs 32.0 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs 15.8 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    10.94 loss vs 192.03 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     403.98     vs 685.51</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Apollo Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - China Apollo is a health drinks and tonic drinks maker.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 1.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs five cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
